otse. See on.

62
00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:57.510
Kõrvad on ka natukene nii

63
00:03:57.610 --> 00:04:00.970
seda pesuvahendit natuke palju,
iga pool nagu.

64
00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.650
On nagu vahutaja,
teine pool on vahu,

65
00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:08.140
see on minu pool on ilus.
Sinu poolt väga ilus.

66
00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:11.415
Loputa pea ära. Eemale. Kõrv jäi.

67
00:04:14.490 --> 00:04:17.515
Tule siis pildi peale ma teen pilti
ka.

68
00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:22.570
Saab ka alla panna,
kuidas ma libises, mina, Leenin,

69
00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:26.290
