70
00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:28.690
Ole seal ilusti, noh.

71
00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:31.810
Noh, naerata siis olema ilus,
sa oled väga ilus Vaino

72
00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:35.960
