85
00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:12.255
No.

86
00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:16.540
Minu meelest on on 2000 a venet, aga
ja tema.

87
00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:21.200
Kaks.

88
00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:25.700
10, neli. Ja venesadama ja.

89
00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.850
20 nelja kaa ja.

90
00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:31.125
Kauboi.

91
00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:48.200
No te võite nii kaua mõtetest,
nii kaua kui Jürgen meile tutvustas,

92
00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:51.950
