107
00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:07.450
Nonii, ops autosse.

108
00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:10.560
Kui te arvate,
tegu on Bondi järgmise imeliku

109
00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:15.250
