119
00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:47.290
No nii, tulge.

120
00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:50.140
Siit iste.

121
00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:55.160
Avastasepaon on Langing oskella
ja isarin maja ja.

122
00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:18.270
Fort Elizabeth
